  "body": "getPrimaryService and other methods rely on GetGATTChildren algorithm to obtain GATT objects. Should they fail if not connected?\n\nThe Chromium implementation currently attempts to obtain this information even when not connected. It could be cached, so it is possible to allow implementations to attempt to service these requests, but it would be cleaner to specify either that they must attempt cached results or reject with a known error.\n",
